ue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wisdom 5 and Running Silent and/or Glory 5 and Berserker's Might.<br /> <br /> Terminal velocity damage caps at 10 Lethal.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's good to know; I don't actually own the NWoD core, so I was just extrapolating from the 10' = 1B thing.<br /> <br /> I think I like using 120B instead of 10L for this, if only because otherwise the answer is just entering Gauru. So anyone can choose to go with either number (10L is a lot easier to deal with, especially if you <i>also</i> want to go with skydiving without the space-suit.)<br /> <br /> Oh, and another for-fun add-on; can anyone give me a <i>starting character</i> that can survive a fall from orbit?If only because it would sound <i>really impressive</i> to say that the reason you got a dot of Glory was for falling from orbit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":1170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","user":"amechra","date":". 03-10-2015, 10:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T19:43:22-07:00","id":436563,"title":"","content":"Red sticks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[]